  "factor_name": "Discrete breadth-regime risk-adjusted relative momentum",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "shift( (log(close_t/close_{t-30}) - cross_sectional_median) / annualized_std(log_returns,30) * regime(breadth_50), 1)",
    "description": "Thirty-session cross-sectional relative momentum divided by 30-session realized volatility. The signal follows momentum when at least 60% of tradable assets are above their 50-session moving average, reverses momentum when at most 40% are above it, and is neutral otherwise. Lagged one session to prevent look-ahead."
